# Trivy findings accepted on purpose. Each needs a reason.

# Restrict container images to trusted registries: enforced by a cluster-wide
# admission policy (e.g. Kyverno), not something a Deployment manifest can set.
KSV-0125

# Workloads in the default namespace: deliberate, all apps on this cluster live
# there. Names are prefixed with APP_NAME, and every manifest sets its namespace
# from K8S_NAMESPACE in deploy.yml, so moving later is a one-line change.
KSV-0110
